WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
Sojourner: Employment Toolkit walkthrough, 81.88 s, no audio track and no narration.
These captions describe what is on screen. Text in quotation marks is shown on screen.
Cue times were measured from the final video's visible page changes
(source commit d31e95e38d0de614f8a0a03af5988616a97214f8).
All people, employers, listings and records shown are fictional demo data.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Opening title added for the recording]
"Find the opportunities actually worth pursuing."
"Sojourner · local-first Career Ops"

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.400
[Sojourner, Target Tracks] The fictional user opens their target track,
"Practice operations", kept separate from their paused current track.
On-screen caption: "Start with where you want to go."

3
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.000
[Find Jobs] One fictional listing appears:
Practice Operations Coordinator, Harbor Health, Baltimore, MD.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.500
[Opportunity assessment] Results are kept separate:
"Eligibility · Unclear", "Evidence · Partial", "Career · Aligned", "Preferences · Mixed".
A potential blocker: required Epic EHR experience has no confirmed support.
On-screen caption: "Separate evidence, alignment, blockers, preferences, and unknowns."

5
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:35.300
[Evidence coverage] 3 direct, 1 transferable, 0 to confirm, 2 gaps,
followed by what Sojourner still does not know about the listing.

6
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.100
The assessment is closed. Back on Find Jobs, the My Career menu opens
and Career Evidence is chosen.

7
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:48.600
[Career Evidence] Scrolls to "Review and correct confirmed evidence":
a CPR/BLS credential, two past roles and one achievement.
On-screen caption: "Keep every claim grounded in work you can support."

8
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:56.800
[Find Jobs] The assessment is reopened and "Prepare resume" is chosen for this listing.
On-screen caption: "Prepare and track the opportunities you deliberately choose."

9
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.300
[Resume] The resume builder targets the tracked job.
A fictional email address, morgan.rivera@example.org, is typed,
then "Create truthful draft" is selected.

10
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:06.500
The draft is built only from confirmed Career Evidence
and shows "Truth Gate passed". "Export verified PDF" is selected.

11
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.300
The exported version, "PDF v1", is listed as passed
and linked to the tracked application.

12
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.000
[Applications] The tracked application's status is changed from Interested to Applied.
This records a status on this device; nothing is sent to the employer.

13
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.750
Application details show one linked resume file under "Submitted files":
"PDF v1 · submitted", recorded on this device.

14
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:21.880
On-screen caption: "Local-first Career Ops. Quality over quantity."
